abstract: >
  OpenClaw is a WhatsApp-native agentic LLM orchestration system deployed across
  three Indian SMB production instances. It treats WhatsApp as the primary operating
  interface, layering persistent memory (Mem0), semantic search (Qdrant), and local
  inference (Ollama) to enable multi-domain business automation without proprietary
  SaaS platforms.
